ly interested in becoming a generic agency. I\u2019d rather work with businesses that already feel operational pain and need someone technical to help untangle it properly.<p>For those of you who\u2019ve made this jump:<p>* how did you get your first real project?\n* what kind of outreach actually worked?\n* did your first few clients come from network, content, cold outreach, partnerships, subcontracting, or somewhere else?<p>Also, if anyone knows SMEs or operators dealing with this sort of mess, I\u2019d be glad to chat.<p>As a gesture of goodwill, I\u2019m offering the first 5 clients 10 hours free to help get an initial project moving.<p>You can find me over at https:&#x2F;&#x2F;crescita.cc", "title": "Ask HN: How did you land your first projects as a solo engineer/consultant?", "updated_at": "2026-10-21T13:28:06Z"}, {"_highlightResult": {"author": {"matchLevel": "none", "matchedWords": [], "value": "hhs"}, "title": {"fullyHighlighted": false, "matchLevel": "full", "matchedWords": ["consultancy"], "value": "Nonprofit hospitals spend billions on <em>consultants</em> with no clear effect"}, "url": {"fullyHighlighted": false, "matchLevel": "full", "matchedWords": ["consultancy"], "value": "https://www.uchicagomedicine.org/forefront/research-and-discoveries-articles/nonprofit-hospitals-spend-billions-on-management-<em>consultants</em>"}}, "_tags": ["story", "author_hhs", "story_48056158"], "author": "hhs", "children": [48056778, 48056833, 48056876, 48056974, 48057017, 48057075, 48057082, 48057269, 48057526, 48057560, 48057562, 48057705, 48058070, 48058146, 48058176, 48059148, 48059172, 48059935, 48061304, 48061670, 48062749], "created_at": "2026-05-07T22:54:34Z", "created_at_i": 1778194474, "num_comments": 80, "objectID": "48056158", "points": 207, "story_id": 48056158, "title": "Nonprofit hospitals spend billions on consultants with no clear effect", "updated_at": "2026-05-20T02:51:15Z", "url": "https://www.uchicagomedicine.org/forefront/research-and-discoveries-ar